94
00:02:34.566 --> 00:02:35.346
state,

95
00:02:35.346 --> 00:02:36.826
not pixels.

96
00:02:36.826 --> 00:02:38.526
Possession isn't enough.

97
00:02:38.526 --> 00:02:40.166
Forged inventory and broken

98
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:42.267
