99
00:02:42.267 --> 00:02:43.027
Now attack

100
00:02:43.037 --> 00:02:44.257
the timeline nine

101
00:02:44.257 --> 00:02:45.687
different ways.

102
00:02:45.687 --> 00:02:47.107
Every hostile candidate

103
00:02:47.107 --> 00:02:48.357
reaches the exact

104
00:02:48.407 --> 00:02:48.637
red

105
00:02:49.097 --> 00:02:50.317
boundary that explains

106
00:02:50.317 --> 00:02:51.427
