119
00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.591
The common idea is not Mars or a passport.

120
00:03:07.591 --> 00:03:10.667
It is an inspectable history of software state.

121
00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:14.512
Check what the model accepted, why it refused a bad

122
00:03:14.512 --> 00:03:16.434
